{"actionability": 5, "autonomy": 5, "blind_sha256": "d329c525ab20433a11f4bfbbc20b4aa9d2c09a239b92230026172f77637381df", "blocker": false, "concision": 4, "correctness": 5, "criteria": [true, true, true], "evaluation_id": "senior-public-contract-migration-r9b-d329c525ab20", "http_attempts": 1, "judge": "responses-api-senior-public-contract-migration-judge-r9b", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "judged_at": "2026-09-01T09:26:46.957428Z", "label": "B", "notes": "准确将问题定位为高风险公共契约重构，明确在来源、Owner、调用闭包和兼容约束缺失时停在 Round 0、冻结代码，而非先改后补。逐项覆盖字段事实源、生产读写方、builder/converter、外部契约与 API 治理，并在 MIG-001 中给出 ADD/MODIFY/DELETE/non-write、行为不变量、先 RED 后生产修改及验收 Green 的可执行路径；停止和扩围条件也明确。还明确禁止把 Route/Transaction 的稳定上游事实与 Ledger/持久化派生结果混装并永久固化进 Core。验证证据、独立检查、回滚和兼容层退役条件充分，信息密度高。", "pair_id": "senior-should-freeze-public-contract-closure-before-coding:1", "safety": 5}
