{"actionability": 4, "autonomy": 4, "blind_sha256": "d329c525ab20433a11f4bfbbc20b4aa9d2c09a239b92230026172f77637381df", "blocker": false, "concision": 3, "correctness": 3, "criteria": [false, false, false], "evaluation_id": "senior-public-contract-migration-r9b-d329c525ab20", "http_attempts": 1, "judge": "responses-api-senior-public-contract-migration-judge-r9b", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "judged_at": "2026-09-01T09:26:46.957428Z", "label": "A", "notes": "明确反对先删接口、靠测试补调用方，并给出兼容迁移、验证与停止条件，实施路径较具体。但在字段来源、目标 Owner、生产读取闭包和 API 治理尚未完成枚举前，仍建议先新增 record/default 方法并开始迁移，未满足“证据不足即代码冻结”。也没有按要求形成待补齐的 ADD/MODIFY/DELETE/non-write 槽位、immutable RED 与预期 Green。对稳定上游事实和 Route/Ledger 派生结果的边界缺少明确判定，示例还可能将领域字段直接固化进公共 record。内容有价值但偏向通用兼容重构方案，未完全服从高风险准入前置条件。 ", "pair_id": "senior-should-freeze-public-contract-closure-before-coding:3", "safety": 3}
